  "heading": "Deductions from pay, etc., not to be made unless authorized.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 27,
  "text": "No deductions other than those authorised by or under this or any other Act shall be made from the pay, pensions, gratuities, allowances and other benefits due to officers and [1][sailors] under any regulations for the time being in force.",
